WEBVTT

00:03:27.193 --> 00:03:30.188
When I started Saddleback Church,
I was 25 years old.

00:03:30.609 --> 00:03:35.015
I started it with
one other family in 1980.

00:03:35.674 --> 00:03:37.976
And I decided that I was never
going to go on TV,

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:39.922
because I didn't want to be a celebrity.

00:03:39.946 --> 00:03:43.127
I didn't want to be a, quote,
"evangelist, televangelist" --

00:03:43.151 --> 00:03:45.000
that's not my thing.

00:03:45.896 --> 00:03:50.170
And all of the sudden, it brought a lot
of money and a lot of attention.

00:03:50.194 --> 00:03:51.734
I don't think --

00:03:51.758 --> 00:03:52.999
now, this is a worldview,

00:03:53.023 --> 00:03:55.473
and I will tell you,
everybody's got a worldview.

00:03:56.037 --> 00:03:58.096
Everybody's betting
their life on something.

00:03:58.120 --> 00:03:59.957
You're betting your life on something,

00:03:59.981 --> 00:04:03.385
you just better know why
you're betting what you're betting on.